<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SunGard Data upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SunGard Data upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded SunGard Data Systems Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-1/2 to 41-1/4.</p>
</text>
